  <dc:creator>Alexandre Rabérin</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>.NET library that provides serialization features related to QuikGraph data structures.

This package is the serialization subset of the original QuickGraph renamed QuikGraph and ported to .NET Core.

Supported platforms:
- .NET Standard 1.3+
- .NET Core 1.0+
- .NET Framework 3.5+

Supports Source Link</dc:description>
  <dc:identifier>QuikGraph.Serialization</dc:identifier>
